      "writtenOn": "2025-07-29T12:23:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi @henrichataing@google.com ,\nCan you please help with the following:\n\n1. I have updated the patchset to call RenewAudioProviderAndSession  on main thread:\n    https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3398887\n\n2. In HIDL, RenewAudioProviderAndSession is being called on the thread associated with message_loop_.\n    Do you think message_loop_ will always correspond to main thread?\n\n    message_loop_-\u003eDoInThread(base::BindOnce(\n      \u0026BluetoothAudioClientInterface::RenewAudioProviderAndSession,\n                                 base::Unretained(bluetooth_audio_clientif_)));\n\n3. If we compare implementation with HIDL, in AIDL, the message_loop has been removed.\n    In order to call RenewAudioProviderAndSession \"exactly\" the same way as in HIDL, we will need message_loop to be implemented here in AIDL too.\n    But I think if it is okay to call RenewAudioProviderAndSession  on main thread, the latest patch on gerrit should do it.\n\nPlease let me know your thoughts.",
